  "type": "multipleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A block of mass M has a circular cut with a frictionless surface as shown. The block rests on the horizontal frictionless surface of a fixed table. Initially the right edge of the block is at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> , in a coordinate system fixed to the table. A point mass m is released from rest at the topmost point of the path as shown and it slides down. When the mass loses contact with the block its position is x and velocity is v. At that instant which of the following options is correct?<br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/cwliqyotkcymhtzliwdasvimbhxqwctwdqhxhdnpmprbqarphv.jpeg\"/></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "SYzU2",
      "text": "The velocity of the point mass m is <math><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "kSnS3",
      "text": "The velocity of the block M is  <math><mi>v</mi><mo>=-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></msqrt></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "tQmns",
      "text": "The position of the point mass is  <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "mkxjM",
      "text": "The x component of displacement of the centre of the mass of block M is <math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/1_solu_phys_pa1.jpg\"/></p><p>When the centre of mass of the system is at origin,</p><p><math><msub><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math></p><p><math><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></math></p><p><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/1_solu_phys_pa1_2.jpg\"/></p><p>The linear momentum of the system is conserved.</p><p><math><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msub><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><msub><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math></p><p><math><msub><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><msub><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>From energy conservation,</p><p><math><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>M</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math></p><p><math><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>M</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
